    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hallow Maze is a 2.5D metroidvania, with a fast and fluid combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual style is hand-painted and the artistic style is dark gothic fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to transform into creatures and use the power of tools to slay enemies, solve puzzles and discover the truth hidden in the depths of the earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/7f7e3984db7265f8cfb3ef04288cf27d.avif?t=1755611918\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game artstyle is  hand painted carefully desinged in a 2-5D world. Using the best mechanics of the metroidvania genre that we thought were important both to problem solving and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/1d95ff43bbc2c2cba5114fa93e944853.avif?t=1755611918\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat is fast paced, fluid and full of tools that adapt to the playstyle of the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/edda6943392c4320671096815c93db98.avif?t=1755611918\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The highlight of the game are the bosses, difficult fights in which you should use all your arsenal and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/3cd5297a0ebd12a32634180938ed6184.avif?t=1755611918\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hallow Maze is a 2.5D metroidvania, with a fast and fluid combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual style is hand-painted and the artistic style is dark gothic fantasy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to transform into creatures and use the power of tools to slay enemies, solve puzzles and discover the truth hidden in the depths of the earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/7f7e3984db7265f8cfb3ef04288cf27d.avif?t=1755611918\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game artstyle is  hand painted carefully desinged in a 2-5D world. Using the best mechanics of the metroidvania genre that we thought were important both to problem solving and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/1d95ff43bbc2c2cba5114fa93e944853.avif?t=1755611918\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat is fast paced, fluid and full of tools that adapt to the playstyle of the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/edda6943392c4320671096815c93db98.avif?t=1755611918\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The highlight of the game are the bosses, difficult fights in which you should use all your arsenal and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508560/extras/3cd5297a0ebd12a32634180938ed6184.avif?t=1755611918\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Hallow Maze is an epic action adventure through an intricate world submerged in war. Explore twisting caves, enormous palaces, battle unhuman horrors and help those in need, in a gothic hand painted 2.5D artstyle.",
